    "detailed_description": "You awaken on the Ritual Altar inside the Life Cathedral, with no memory or strength left. How long has it been? Who are you?<br><br>Venture down into the mountainous kingdom, loot dismal villages on the cliffside, navigate through spiralling stone dungeons and crypts, accumulate enough of the writhing Life Blood, and unseal the long-lost secrets hidden deep within the rock heart of the mountain.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629670/extras/77c7c8e58f6f59b4190597db7ee05b37.avif?t=1753914996\" width=616 height=180 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Controlled Combat - A tense but rewarding combat system that requires quick reflexes and careful use of the game's mechanics.<br></li><li>Interconnected World - Find shortcuts, unlock doors, and activate elevators that aid your route across the cursed land.<br></li><li>Flexible Playstyle - Whether Sword, Axe or Dagger, different situations call for each weapon's unique set of attributes.<br></li><li>Exploration is Everything - Hidden paths and secret chests might house that single item you need to push forward - items are abundant but require a keen eye.<br></li><li>Shattered Storyline - From items to the characters you meet, the secrets of the past are waiting to be uncovered.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629670/extras/3db0cbbd944eef1fc5b6d2e99879bfab.avif?t=1753914996\" width=616 height=180 /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "You awaken on the Ritual Altar inside the Life Cathedral, with no memory or strength left. How long has it been? Who are you?<br><br>Venture down into the mountainous kingdom, loot dismal villages on the cliffside, navigate through spiralling stone dungeons and crypts, accumulate enough of the writhing Life Blood, and unseal the long-lost secrets hidden deep within the rock heart of the mountain.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629670/extras/77c7c8e58f6f59b4190597db7ee05b37.avif?t=1753914996\" width=616 height=180 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Controlled Combat - A tense but rewarding combat system that requires quick reflexes and careful use of the game's mechanics.<br></li><li>Interconnected World - Find shortcuts, unlock doors, and activate elevators that aid your route across the cursed land.<br></li><li>Flexible Playstyle - Whether Sword, Axe or Dagger, different situations call for each weapon's unique set of attributes.<br></li><li>Exploration is Everything - Hidden paths and secret chests might house that single item you need to push forward - items are abundant but require a keen eye.<br></li><li>Shattered Storyline - From items to the characters you meet, the secrets of the past are waiting to be uncovered.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629670/extras/3db0cbbd944eef1fc5b6d2e99879bfab.avif?t=1753914996\" width=616 height=180 /></span>",
